WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700
Every nonprofit needs a place
to do the work.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.400
We couldn't find one built for us.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.250
So we built our own.
Introducing ABLE HQ.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:16.850
And Abe, your ABLE admin,
assisting you each step of the way.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.050
Every donor thanked.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:24.600
A gift comes in, and the thank-you
is ready before the coffee cools.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.850
And I'm going to show the kids
you could look like this,

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.200
you could sound like this, and be
whatever you want to be in life.

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:30.550
Every story shared.

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:32.500
Nia schedules the post.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:35.550
Abe drafts the replies,
and she sends them.

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:38.450
Two o'clock. The team meets
inside ABLE HQ.

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:42.200
The board fills in as they talk,
and Abe keeps the notes.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:47.400
Send the tasks, and everyone
knows what's next.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.500
Every plan in motion.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:55.250
And wherever the team is,
ABLE HQ goes with them.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:57.950
Onboarding a new mentor?

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.700
Send the packet,
and it comes back signed.

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:03.650
By evening, the numbers are in.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:06.850
Every program measured:

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.150
reach, attendance, growth.

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:12.050
Straight into the grant report
and the board pack.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:13.750
Always board ready.

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:17.450
And everything else it takes
to run a nonprofit.

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.900
We've been quiet
because we've been building.

00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:26.850
Infrastructure that lasts.

00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:28.650
More room for the...

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.500
ABLE HQ, built by a nonprofit
for the way nonprofits work.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.400
We are ABLE.
